  ('zcrm_5797994000003721277', 'Environmental Transit Authority', 'Environmental Transit Authority', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Michael Hastings', 'Manufacturer of solar-powered, pedal-powered micro electric vehicles intended for sustainable urban transportation. The company incorporates lightweight vehicle construction, integrated solar charging, pedal-assist functionality, and compact design, enabling consumers to access low-emission and health-promoting mobility options for daily travel within cities and communities.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-15 21:25:55', '2026-02-15 21:25:55', NULL),
