  ('zcrm_5797994000003721587', 'Predictive Horizons', 'Predictive Horizons', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Mohamad Yassine', 'Developer of an AI prognostics platform designed to ensure the safety and security of every occupant on the road by preventing problems before they ever happen. The company''s platform provides insights from vehicle data by collecting and analyzing it and offers features like AI agents, development SDK, fleet management and GDPR compliance, enabling automotive manufacturers to reduce their warranty costs, accelerate engineering systems and prevent costly recalls by transforming vast amounts of service data into actionable, fleet-wide intelligence.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-16 07:43:59', '2026-02-16 07:43:59', NULL),
