  ('zcrm_5797994000003721977', 'hearthero', 'HeartHero', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Gary Montague', 'Developer of an automated external defibrillator (AED) intended to empower anyone, anywhere to save a life from sudden cardiac arrest. The company''s defibrillator is a portable, easy-to-use device powered by a store-bought battery. It can automatically diagnose life-threatening cardiac arrhythmias, including ventricular fibrillation (VF) and pulseless ventricular tachycardia, and treat them through defibrillation, enabling patients to receive help during sudden cardiac arrest.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Burhan Ayubali', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 16:00:51', '2026-02-17 16:00:51', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003723051', 'AvaWatz', 'AvaWatz', 'Pranay Kakkar', 'Rajini Anachi', 'Developer of an artificial intelligence-based decision platform designed to provide end-to-end private or hybrid cloud-based services. The company''s platform specializes in computer vision and autonomous robotic teaming services using machine learning and physics-based algorithmic technologies, enabling commercial and government clients to get increased work done and also improve human safety.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Pranay Kakkar', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-18 05:31:36', '2026-02-18 05:31:36', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724004', 'Cytodyme', 'Cytodyme', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Dennis White', 'Developer of a clinical development platform designed to focus life-science and biotech companies on clinical development and regulatory compliance. The company''s platform utilizes AI to generate, organize, update, and manage regulatory documents such as SOPs, batch records, material specifications, and regulatory reports like IND submissions, change controls, ensuring accuracy by applying formatting, while also identifying missing or incomplete documents and adhering to standards, enabling biotech teams to streamline workflows, maintain compliance, and accelerate documentation review and finalization.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Burhan Ayubali', 'Quick Screen', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 16:10:10', '2026-03-08 13:25:37', '2026-03-08 13:25:37'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724030', 'dkrasne@sentiremedical.com', 'Sentire Medical Systems', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'David Krasne', 'Developer of a monitoring system designed to alert surgeons and physicians to the presence of bowel perforations during and after laparoscopic surgical procedures. The company''s system alerts surgeons to facilitate immediate repair, protecting patients from risks and costs of potentially catastrophic complications associated with laparoscopic surgery, enabling surgeons to reduce readmission, improve patient outcomes, and reduce costs for payers and providers.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Burhan Ayubali', 'On Hold', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 16:19:30', '2026-02-27 07:19:34', '2026-02-27 07:21:07'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724056', 'ALM Ortho', 'ALM Ortho', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Paul Dejulis', 'Developer of a medical technology designed to improve and deliver orthopedic implants for the spine. The company''s technology leverages additive manufacturing and advanced software tools for patients'' complex orthopedic problems, including osseointegration, limb lengthening, total joint arthroplasty revision, and traumatic problems, enabling healthcare institutions to enhance patient outcomes and quality of life.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Burhan Ayubali', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 16:26:48', '2026-02-17 16:26:48', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724083', 'SOMAVAC', 'SOMAVAC', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Elizabeth Hoff', 'Developer of a sustained vacuum system designed to improve the recovery experience after surgeries. The company offers a discreet, wearable device that automatically manages post-surgical fluid drainage through a closed suction system, reducing the need for manual bulb drains and minimizing discomfort, enabling patients recovering from surgeries to experience a more comfortable and efficient healing process.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Burhan Ayubali', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 16:34:55', '2026-02-17 16:34:55', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724134', 'Certivo', 'Certivo', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Chetan Desh', 'Developer of an AI-powered compliance management platform designed to help businesses turn product compliance from an operational burden into a competitive edge. The company''s platform provides features such as real-time regulation updates, automated document validation, proactive risk insights, risk alerts, and comprehensive impact analysis, thereby enabling clients to automate regulatory monitoring, risk management, document control, and stay compliant efficient, and ready for the market.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 18:08:38', '2026-02-17 18:08:38', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724167', 'Superset', 'Superset', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Neil Staunton', 'Developer of cross-chain token infrastructure designed for interoperability across blockchain networks. The company''s platform offers integration with blockchain environments, supports multiple programming languages, allows unwrapped asset transfers with instant settlement, synchronizes compliance and yield properties across networks, and eliminates the need for contract redeployment, enabling decentralized finance developers and token issuers to streamline multi-chain deployments, preserve asset functionality across chains, and reduce operational complexity in a fragmented blockchain ecosystem.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 18:33:04', '2026-02-17 18:33:04', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724193', 'Pelgo', 'Pelgo', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Chieh Huang', 'Developer of an AI-powered career support platform designed to support individuals in navigating job transitions and planning career steps. The company offers a platform that combines AI-driven job services with a centralized command center for people teams to track placement success, with applicant tracking system integration, profile optimization, and segment departing, enabling its users to access personalized pathways, career coaching, and job placement assistance to prepare for transitions and make more informed career decisions.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 18:41:15', '2026-02-17 18:41:15', NULL),
