  ('zcrm_5797994000003724250', 'Tellen', 'Tellen', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Deepak Lalit', 'Developer of an artificial intelligence-powered platform designed to transform audit and accounting practices by enhancing accuracy, efficiency, and compliance. The company offers tailored tools for GAAP and GAAS-compliant documentation, secure zero-trust', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Quick Screen', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 19:02:19', '2026-03-09 15:52:57', '2026-03-09 15:52:57'),
