  ('zcrm_5797994000003724303', 'Lucor', 'Lucor', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Krystal Erickson', 'Developer of an AI platform designed to support payment integrity and investigative teams in identifying fraud, waste, and abuse. The company offers explainable AI that detects evolving fraud patterns, integrates with existing post-pay workflows, and accelerates investigator triage and decision-making, enabling U.S. health plans across commercial and government-sponsored programs to increase investigative impact without expanding staff.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 19:27:24', '2026-02-17 19:27:24', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724329', 'Makon', 'Makon', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Asilbek Ashurov', 'Developer of an AI-powered SAT preparation platform designed to help students improve standardized test performance. The company''s platform includes exam-aligned practice questions, full-length digital tests, adaptive study planning, vocabulary tools, detailed explanations, an interactive AI tutor for user questions, video-based walkthroughs, progress tracking, and performance analytics, enabling secondary school students preparing for college entrance examinations to identify weaknesses, practice targeted skills, and improve readiness consistently.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 19:32:18', '2026-03-03 07:59:36', '2026-03-03 07:59:36'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724355', 'PLCs', 'PLCs.ai', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Zohar Kantor', 'AI‑based tools analyze, generate, and document PLC code to give deep insight into components, dependencies, and automation logic. Huge unlock for teams designing and maintaining industrial control systems.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 19:37:01', '2026-02-17 19:37:01', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724381', 'EdenCode', 'EdenCode', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Wanda Hou', 'Developer of an AI-powered quantum error correction platform designed to improve the reliability of quantum computing systems. The company offers adaptive error modeling, automated correction workflows, and hardware-aware optimization, enabling quantum computing developers and research institutions to improve computational stability and more accurate results.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-17 19:51:01', '2026-02-17 19:51:01', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724418', 'Luron AI', 'Luron AI', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Burak Aktas', 'Developer of automated communication technology designed for customer interaction purposes. The company''s platform provides continuous availability through voice-enabled systems that answer calls at all times, support over forty languages, schedule appointments, and handle service requests with consistency and accuracy, enabling businesses to maintain uninterrupted responsiveness, reduce dependency on human resources, optimize operational efficiency, and extend accessibility to a broad and diverse customer base across different regions and time zones.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-18 05:26:46', '2026-02-18 05:26:46', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724444', 'IQLand', 'IQLand', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Phillip Boykin', 'Developer of an AI-powered insights platform designed for reshaping real estate. The company''s AI-driven platform harnesses a comprehensive parcel database offering enhanced feasibility assessments, precise architectural plan matching, enabling real estate developers, agents, builders, and homeowners to efficiently and accurately evaluate real estate development projects.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'On Hold', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-18 05:40:50', '2026-02-18 10:04:32', '2026-02-18 10:04:56'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724470', 'Pitz', 'Pitz', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Natalia Salcedo Franco', 'Pitz is the first AI-powered copilot for automotive repair shops—built to make 24-hour car repairs a reality. Through voice-driven workflows, automated procurement, and embedded financing, Pitz streamlines every step of the repair process so mechanics can work faster, smarter, and without friction.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-18 05:48:37', '2026-02-18 05:48:37', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724496', 'Opsin', 'Opsin', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'James Pham', 'Opsin safeguard enterprises from data exposure risks (oversharing) in using Microsoft Copilot, Google Gemini, and Glean. We are working with enterprises such as Culligan International, Cascade Environmental to protect their Microsoft Copilot deployments.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-18 05:54:18', '2026-02-18 05:54:18', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724527', 'Marquee', 'Marquee', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Dror Rosenfeld', 'Developer of an AI-driven sports analytics platform designed to consolidate and interpret diverse performance data for player evaluation and decision support. The company connects multiple data sources and filters them through club identity models to deliver contextualized insights, enabling sports organizations and talent scouts to reduce manual effort, uncover high-value players, and support data-informed recruitment and operational decisions within the sports technology and athlete intelligence market.', 'HV Genesis', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Have not Reached out', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-18 05:57:02', '2026-02-18 05:57:02', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003724548', 'Nauta', 'Nauta', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Valentina Jordan', 'Nauta is a cutting-edge, AI-powered B2B SaaS platform designed to streamline and transform the logistics and trade industry. With a focus on interconnecting the key players in the supply chain, Nauta helps companies automate up to 75% of operational tasks, reducing manual processes and errors.
Founded by industry experts who experienced firsthandthe challenges of fragmented logistics operations, Nauta offers a user-friendly platform that doesn’t require technical knowledge or complex integrations. It provides real-time visibility and control over shipments, enabling companies to better manage their supply chain, save time, and lower costs.
By leveraging AI to capture and structure data, Nauta helps businesses make informed decisions, ensuring smooth operations across the logistics chain. Trusted by companies across the world, Nauta is revolutionizing the logistics sector, one container at a time​​.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-18 05:59:56', '2026-02-18 05:59:56', NULL),
