  ('zcrm_5797994000003724600', 'Bite Data', 'BITE Data', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Thariq Kara', 'BITE provides global trade teams with instant answers on tariffs, restricted parties, and supply chain risks — just by uploading their data. In seconds, they see what regulations apply, what actions to take, and where to source smarter. BITE provides our core ICP, Global Trade Managers, with: • AI-ready structured supply chain & regulatory datain one place to save time • Agentic workflows to perform global trade tasks efficiently to plug supply chain leaks • Alternative sourcing options to improve cost-savings and bottom line BITE is the copilot for global trade teams, taking data out of messy, monolithic ERPs, and into a B2B SaaS platform that allows them to trade compliantly and to make better strategic decisions using AI recommendations.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-18 06:15:33', '2026-02-18 06:15:33', NULL),
