  ('zcrm_5797994000003752210', 'Gaia Box', 'Gaia Box', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Thad Peyton', 'Gaia Box builds modular agricultural systems that combine crop production with optional renewable energy integration. Their self-contained units allow clients to grow food efficiently while reducing environmental impact and reliance on external resources.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 07:00:03', '2026-02-23 07:00:03', '2026-02-23 07:00:03'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752245', 'En Solucion', 'En Solucion', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Alex Athey', 'En Solución develops agricultural technology that improves food safety through advanced cleaning and sanitization methods. Their platform explores nanotechnology as a safer alternative to traditional chlorine-based post-harvest washes.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 07:09:16', '2026-02-23 07:09:16', '2026-02-23 07:09:16'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752285', 'Alter Eco Foods', 'Alter Eco Foods', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Keith Bearden', 'Alter Eco Foods produces organic, ethically sourced chocolate and natural food products. Their dark chocolate, truffles, and granola are designed to provide healthier options while supporting sustainable and fair supply chains.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 07:19:40', '2026-02-23 07:19:40', '2026-02-23 07:19:40'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752325', 'Numanac', 'Numanac', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Daniel Lee', 'Numanac develops an AI-powered platform that helps farmers access relevant insights from large datasets. It enables better farm management, risk assessment, and data-driven decision-making.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Source', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 07:22:55', '2026-02-23 07:22:55', '2026-02-23 07:22:55'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752365', 'Ucrop.it', 'Ucrop.it', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Diego Hoter', 'Ucrop.it provides a platform that connects farmers and companies through secure data sharing and blockchain traceability. It helps track and communicate sustainability efforts such as carbon reduction and regenerative agriculture practices.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'One Pager', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 07:26:17', '2026-03-08 16:25:09', '2026-03-08 16:25:09'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752405', 'TrueNatural', 'TrueNatural', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Darwin Alvarez', 'TrueNatural is a U.S.-based agritech company that develops microbial biological amendments to improve soil health, plant resilience, and water quality. Its BioReactor technology enables on-site activation and cost-efficient deployment of these biological solutions for farmers and turf managers.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sustainability', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aidan Drumm', 'Investment Memo', 'Sustainability', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 07:34:35', '2026-03-24 08:56:39', '2026-03-24 08:56:39'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752456', 'Daro', 'Daro', 'Madhav Jami', 'Kristen Bernhard', 'Provider of surveillance systems intended to revolutionize farm resiliency. The company offers pathogen surveillance to detect, forecast, and prevent diseases to enhance livestock health, productivity, and biosecurity, enabling farmers to make informed decisions for optimal management and improved outcomes.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 14:50:24', '2026-02-23 14:50:24', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752482', 'SanaHeal', 'SanaHeal', 'Madhav Jami', 'Patrick Rivelli', 'Developer of bioadhesive medical technologies designed to achieve rapid and strong adhesion to wet and irregular tissue surfaces. The company offers nature-inspired adhesives modeled after barnacles and spider webs that clean and bond to uneven or contaminated areas, provide instant drying and secure attachment in moist environments, and undergo pre-clinical testing, enabling healthcare providers and medical device manufacturers to improve wound closure and tissue repair with materials that adhere effectively in challenging biological conditions.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 14:53:51', '2026-02-23 14:53:51', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752508', 'Rowan', 'Rowan', 'Madhav Jami', 'Corin Wagen', 'Developer of a computational platform designed to simulate and analyze molecules and materials. The company''s platform utilizes machine learning and advanced computational methods to stimulate acid dissociation prediction, low-energy conformer searches, and three-dimensional structure editing, enabling researchers and scientists to enhance their productivity and efficiency.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 15:02:49', '2026-02-23 15:02:49', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752534', 'Functional Fluidics', 'Functional Fluidics', 'Madhav Jami', 'Patrick Hines', 'Operator of a blood diagnostics unit intended to monitor red blood cell health objectively. The company''s unit primarily offers a suite of proprietary blood function assays that are well-validated and can be used to scrutinize red blood cells to provide contract research services to pharmaceutical, biotech, and academic research companies, enabling clients to improve patient care by accessing objective data on red blood cell health.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Madhav Jami', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 15:10:55', '2026-02-23 15:10:55', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752654', 'PawCo Foods', 'PawCo Foods', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Masha Vazin', 'PawCo Foods is engaged in research and development of plant-based food compositions, as described in ''Plant-based food compositions.'' Their work involves creating plant-based meat base compositions that include textured protein, a starch binder, water, and optional coloring agents, as well as methods for making these compositions. This focus highlights their efforts in developing plant-based alternatives for pet foods using specific ingredient combinations and processing techniques. Seed', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 12:12:25', '2026-02-24 12:12:25', '2026-02-24 12:12:25'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752711', 'Plantcraft', 'Plantcraft', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Csaba Hetenyi', 'Plantcraft is disrupting one of the least developed categories in plant-based alternatives by making the most delicious and cleanest deli meats in the world. Seed', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 12:24:38', '2026-02-24 12:24:38', '2026-02-24 12:24:38'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752746', 'High Time Foods', 'High Time Foods', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Aakash Shah', 'High Time Foods provides shelf-stable and moldable plant-based meat alternatives to foodservice operators. Their first product is a plant-based chicken alternative that does not require refrigeration. The product is moldable and can be used in any cuisine as a substitute for chicken. Seed', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 12:31:34', '2026-02-24 12:31:34', '2026-02-24 12:31:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752782', 'Thrilling Foods', 'Thrilling Foods', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Jared Hansen', 'Thrilling Foods is engaged in the development of plant-based food products, focusing on innovative tofu compositions. Their research involves creating tofu with multiple layers, where one layer contains added fat and another does not. This method involves introducing fat into soymilk before curdling, allowing for distinct textural and flavor profiles. This approach aligns with their mission to produce high-quality plant-based alternatives, such as their renowned plant bacon. Pre-Seed', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 12:40:47', '2026-02-24 12:40:47', '2026-02-24 12:40:47'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752817', 'Refresh Gum', 'Refresh Gum', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Ryan Stafford', 'Plant-based chewing gum using chicle and natural ingredients. Seed', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 12:46:09', '2026-02-24 12:46:09', '2026-02-24 12:46:09'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752852', 'Paradise Spreads', 'Paradise Spreads', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'David Glenn', 'Paradise Spreads provides organic, sweet plant-based protein spreads, and snacks that are gluten-free, healthy, and convenient. The company was founded in 2017 and is based in Schererville, Indiana, United States. Pre-seed', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 12:56:34', '2026-02-24 12:56:34', '2026-02-24 12:56:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752887', 'The Plantbased Seafood Co.', 'The Plant Based Seafood Co.', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Monica Talbert', 'Founded by mother-daughter duo Shelly Van Cleave and Monica Talbert, The Plant Based Seafood Co. leverages the founders'' previous success in creating gourmet seafood delicacies to produce plant-based seafood alternatives sold under the brand, Mind Blown. The company uses a combination of unique and innovative plants and proteins to mimic thetaste, look, and texture of real seafood. Pre-Seed', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 13:22:13', '2026-02-24 13:22:13', '2026-02-24 13:22:13'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752922', 'The Mushroom Meat Co.', 'The Mushroom Meat Co.', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Kesha Stickland', 'The Mushroom Meat is a B2B food technology company. They make mushroom-based meats. Their products include pork less shreds, beefless patties, beefless tips, and customized shapes and flavors. Their products are gluten-free, soy-free, vegan, paleo-friendly and free of the top-12-allergens. Pre-Seed', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 13:30:45', '2026-02-24 13:30:45', '2026-02-24 13:30:45'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752957', 'Holey Grail Donuts', 'Holey Grail Donuts', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Nile Dreiling', 'Holey Grail Donuts is a producer of taro donuts fried in coconut oil, hand-harvested, and crafted. Its services also include catering, orders for groups or parties, outdoor seating, takeaway, and walk-in services. Series A', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 13:38:55', '2026-02-24 13:38:55', '2026-02-24 13:38:55'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003752992', 'Caldo Restaurant Technologies', 'Caldo Restaurant Technologies', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Jose Alonso', 'Caldo Restaurant Technologies is a robotics company that provides kitchen automation technology. OCTO, their initial product, is an automated makeline that handles the "last-mile of cooking." In a nutshell, the system acts as a robotic helper for kitchen personnel, handling ready-to-eat items, processing incoming orders, and autonomouslypreparing bespoke meals in a safe, timely, and waste-free manner.  Seed', 'HV Genesis', 'Consumer', 'Spring 2026', 'Crunchbase', 'Reached Out', 'Jaden Majmudar', 'Source', 'Consumer', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 13:44:39', '2026-02-24 13:44:39', '2026-02-24 13:44:39'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753081', 'Blue', 'Blue', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Omar Abdelaziz', 'Developer of an AI-powered mobile assistant designed to control and operate iPhone apps entirely hands-free. The company offers a voice-driven AI system that executes tasks across apps in real time, enabling users to complete complex workflows through natural conversation without manually interacting with their device.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 08:10:59', '2026-02-24 08:10:59', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753107', 'C&ID', 'C&ID', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Hassan Azmat', 'Developer of internal AI agent systems designed for pre-construction engineering workflows. The company integrates with existing tools and infrastructure to automate specification extraction, generate deviation logs, provide real-time variance alerts, and enable role-based access control and fully auditable workflows, enabling engineering and construction firms to accelerate bidding, reduce schedule overruns, retain institutional knowledge, and improve estimate accuracy with minimal manual intervention.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 08:30:44', '2026-02-24 08:30:44', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753133', 'Astral AI', 'Astral AI', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Savannah Feder', 'Operator of a workflow automation platform designed to simplify digital process management. The company''s platform provides workflow building tools, monitoring features, and access controls, enabling operations teams and technical teams to reduce manual workloads and achieve efficient end-to-end process handling.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 08:38:53', '2026-02-24 08:38:53', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753159', 'Sherpas', 'Sherpas', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Francisco Mico', 'Developer of a wealth management software designed for both advisors and clients. The company''s cloud-based platform allows advisors to manage client portfolios, including investment analysis, rebalancing, and reporting, and helps advisors comply with regulations and manage risk through features like account monitoring and automated alerts, enabling advisors to communicate effectively with clients through secure messaging, document sharing, and online portals.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Lakshita Ganesh Kumar', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 08:49:38', '2026-02-24 08:49:38', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753191', 'Foundry Robotics', 'Foundry Robotics', 'Aditya Raj', 'Adarsh Kulkarni', 'Manufacturer of AI-first, assembly-focused and dual-use robots based in San Francisco, California. The company is currently operating in stealth mode.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aditya Raj', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 13:44:16', '2026-02-24 13:44:16', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753222', 'ZeroDrift', 'ZeroDrift', 'Aditya Raj', 'Kumesh Aroomoogan', 'Developer of a compliance-focused AI platform designed to ensure that every organizational output is validated, compliant and trusted before release. The company offers an automated compliance and validation system that embeds trust and regulatory adherence directly into workflows, enabling customers to eliminate drift, reduce risk and maintain consistent quality across all outputs.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Aditya Raj', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 13:59:13', '2026-02-24 13:59:13', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753267', 'Think Bioscience', 'Think Bioscience', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Jerome Fox', 'Developer of reimagining synthetic biology systems designed to guide the design and assembly of better medicines. The company''s technology encodes a sophisticated molecular objective into a microbial host to identify, build, and evolve small molecules, enabling medical researchers to use microbes in drug discovery.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 20:27:50', '2026-02-24 20:27:50', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753293', 'Bunkerhill Health', 'Bunkerhill Health', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Nishith Khandwala', 'Developer of a healthcare technology platform designed to enable automated clinical reasoning and workflow execution using generative artificial intelligence. The company integrates with full electronic health records and clinical archives to analyze patient data, surface insights, and trigger next steps such as prior authorization, registry submission, documentation, and preventive screening, enabling clients to automate clinical operations and improve care delivery at scale.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 20:34:50', '2026-02-24 20:34:50', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753324', 'Glyphic Biotechnologies', 'Glyphic Biotechnologies', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Joshua Yang', 'Operator of a biotechnology platform intended to increase binding affinity and improve consistency to help create personalized, precision cancer vaccines for patients of all backgrounds. The company''s platform focuses on developing a single-molecule, massively parallel, de novo next-generation protein sequencing platform, enabling scientists and researchers to develop novel therapeutics and diagnostics and ultimately understand human biology and disease.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 20:41:18', '2026-03-23 17:22:42', '2026-03-23 17:22:42'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753350', 'Nabla Bio', 'Nabla Bio', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Surojit Biswas', 'Developer of Artificial Intelligence (AI) and wet-lab technologies designed for the rational designing of developable, selective, and functional drugs. The company offers integrated AI-driven modeling, high-throughput multiplex screening, and wet-lab validation, enabling pharmaceutical companies to create drugs against previously undruggable targets with enhanced precision and efficacy.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 20:48:52', '2026-03-23 17:20:46', '2026-03-23 17:20:46'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753376', 'Matterworks', 'Matterworks', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Niall O''Connor', 'Developer of a machine learning platform designed to support research in the life sciences industry. The company''s platform offers multi-omics data analysis, predictive modeling, automated experiment design, and visualization tools, enabling biotechnology and pharmaceutical researchers to accelerate discovery and improve research efficiency.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 21:00:57', '2026-03-23 17:20:06', '2026-03-23 17:20:06'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753402', 'Ventaris Surgical', 'Ventaris Surgical', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Surag Mantri', 'Developer of advanced surgical technologies designed to improve minimally invasive urological procedures. The company offers a next-generation ureteroscopic system that streamlines procedural steps and supports kidney stone management, enabling urologists and surgical teams to perform procedures more efficiently and with greater procedural control.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 21:11:13', '2026-02-24 21:11:13', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753428', 'Ganymede', 'Ganymede', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Nathan Clark', 'Developer of a cloud-based data automation and analysis platform designed to integrate and harmonize lab instruments and app data quickly. The company''s platform helps to integrate apps, import data, design pipelines, write integrations, connect software and hardware, and push data around with intuitive versioning, enabling software engineers to connect, automate their labs, and speed up operations to accelerate science or production.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Rejected', NULL, 'Acquired', 'Rosemary Moyo', '2026-02-24 21:19:48', '2026-02-24 21:19:48', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753454', 'Etiome', 'Etiome', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Scott Lipnick', 'Developer of a biostaged medicine designed to map the progression of diseases. The company''s technology characterizes disease with increased resolution over time, and medicines are therapies tailored to specific stages of disease, enabling the healthcare industry to intervene at early disease stages and prevent further progression.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 21:34:46', '2026-03-23 15:52:34', '2026-03-23 15:52:34'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753480', 'MycoMedica', 'MycoMedica', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Paul Stamets', 'Developer of genome drug intended to unlock the healing potential of the fungal genome for people and the planet. The company engages in the study of different fungal allies and their usage for human benefits in the prevention and treatment of psychiatric and neurological disorders, enabling medical professionals to fuel fungi-based drug development.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 21:38:38', '2026-03-23 15:45:25', '2026-03-23 15:45:25'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003753506', 'FreeNav', 'FreeNav', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Mina Fahim', 'Developer of a wireless GPS system designed to simplify and standardize the position tracking of procedural instrumentation in medical applications. The company offers a modular, accurate, reliable, and cost-effective solution, enabling medical professionals to overcome current limitations in tracking and positioning, enhancing the precision and efficiency of procedures.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Rosemary Moyo', 'Rejected', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 21:46:48', '2026-03-23 15:31:06', '2026-03-23 15:31:06'),
