  ('zcrm_5797994000003759283', 'American Drone Network', 'American Drone Network', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Erik Kellim', 'Provider of a shared agricultural drone fleet and pilot support services designed to eliminate ownership barriers, reduce costs, and maximize uptime for professional ag drone operators. The company offers a drone network that combines premium fleet access, tiered acreage-based pricing, comprehensive maintenance support, FAA-compliant digital logbooks with crop mapping, and regulatory compliance assistance, enabling clients to reduce upfront investment, minimize downtime, and increase profitable acres flown each season.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Riya Sabadra', '2026-02-22 13:18:39', '2026-03-11 07:51:31', '2026-03-11 07:51:31'),
