  ('zcrm_5797994000003760152', 'MealsForMiles', 'MealsForMiles', 'Angjelo Terolli', 'Rosiyabanu Halilrahman', 'MealsForMiles is a meal replacement shakes with nutrient-dense whole food to keep you full of energy and increased focus while promoting fat loss naturally. In a matter of seconds, you can fuel your body with 30+ whole-food ingredients. A well-balanced meal is a way to maintain your energy on your busy days. It is a complete whole food meal onthe go with 3 billion CFU probiotics, 25 essential vitamins, and minerals in just 30 seconds. 90% less sugar than Herbalife and Usana. 0% of Soy or any other GMO ingredients. 0% of artificial sweeteners or flavors. 0% of artificial food additives and preservatives. Available for Paleo, Vegan, Keto-friendly, and Dairy-free. Available in 8 flavors, provided in a bottle and jar container. Huge advantage in the meal replacement industry is the $21B market where top brands sell with low quality ingredients products. So far QCE GROUP invested $1.18M in the pre-seed round.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Angjelo Terolli', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-23 09:24:21', '2026-02-23 09:24:22', '2026-02-23 09:24:22'),
