  ('zcrm_5797994000003761057', 'FitOS', 'FitOS', 'Angjelo Terolli', 'Vic Kamat', 'FitOS is a health tech startup defining the future of fitness discovery. Our first app, FitLevel, is a Software As A Service (SAAS) app merging in-person and digital workout experiences into one omni-channel platform. FitLevel will redefine discovery, community, and engagement for gym goers and maximize customer retention and acquisition for gymoperators.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Angjelo Terolli', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-02-21 09:27:21', '2026-02-21 09:27:21', '2026-02-21 09:27:21'),
