  ('zcrm_5797994000003765089', 'SoFab Inks', 'SoFab Inks', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Peter Armstrong Ph.D', 'Developer of a perovskite solar cell manufacturing platform intended to offer functionalized materials for perovskite solar cells. The company''s platform specializes in enhancing solar cell efficiency, scalability, stability, and bankability, thereby accelerating the decarbonization of electrification by improving the efficiency, scalability, stability, and bankability of solar cells, enabling photovoltaic cell manufacturers to improve the efficiency and performance of their products.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Riya Sabadra', '2026-02-24 10:25:10', '2026-03-11 08:20:40', '2026-03-11 08:20:40'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003765127', 'Material Hybrid Manufacturing', 'Material Hybrid Manufacturing', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Gabriel Elias', 'Developer of an energy storage manufacturing technology designed for integrating power directly into product structures. The company''s technology enables additive manufacturing of complete energy architectures, including anode, cathode, separator, and casing, eliminating traditional molds and allowing full utilization of internal volume, enabling industries to achieve higher energy density, design flexibility, and scalable production without conventional constraints.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Riya Sabadra', '2026-02-24 10:30:32', '2026-03-11 08:22:08', '2026-03-11 08:22:08'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003765141', 'Saga AI', 'Saga AI', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Jenica Zhong', '24/7 AI‑powered patient support across calls, SMS, and chat while reducing wait times and freeing staff for higher‑value work. The ability to provide fast, secure, compliant communication at scale feels like a major unlock for healthcare operations.', 'HV STEM', 'SaaS', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Vrishin Inampudi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-24 10:32:16', '2026-02-24 10:32:16', NULL),
