  ('zcrm_5797994000003765198', 'Midstream Methanol', 'Midstream Methanol', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Primary Office', 'Manufacturer of natural gas conversion plants intended to offer low delivered methanol cost to regional customers. The company''s plants help clients to reduce transport costs and benefit from cheap shale gas feedstock, enabling clients to reduce costs and risks and schedule using a manufacture-ship-assemble construction model.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-25 07:57:48', '2026-02-25 07:57:48', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003765224', 'Lightsense Technology', 'Lightsense Technology', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Terje Skotheim', 'Manufacturer of infrared and photo-acoustic sensors intended to serve multiple business and consumer applications along with utilizing AI data analytics. The company''s sensors include highly sensitive spectrometers covering the spectrum from ultraviolet to infrared, accurate and have long-term stability and can be used for energy-conserving in smart buildings, methane greenhouse gas emission detection, and monitoring air pollution, enabling business organizations to use miniaturized spectrometers for industrial purposes, illicit drug detection, pathogen detection and a variety of other purposes.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-25 08:01:56', '2026-02-25 08:01:56', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003765255', 'AdBm', 'Adbm Technologies', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Mark Wochner', 'Manufacturer of underwater acoustics intended to develop noise mitigation for marine environments. The company''s technology uses large arrays of Helmholtz resonators, tuned to specific frequencies, to capture and mitigate noise from various noise sources, enabling clients to protect marine wildlife from the potentially damaging effects of industrial operations in the sea.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-25 08:06:02', '2026-02-25 08:06:02', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003765289', 'Vertical Semiconductor', 'Vertical Semiconductor', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Cynthia Liao', 'Developer of vertical power electronics designed to enable higher density and efficiency in power converters for data centers and grid infrastructure. The company offers scalable vertical GaN technology with improved voltage range, lower thermal resistance, and compact manufacturing processes, enabling data centers and power system providers to achieve smaller footprints, efficiency, and reduced total cost of ownership.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Daniel Carreno', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-02-25 08:10:46', '2026-02-25 08:10:46', NULL),
