  ('zcrm_5797994000003772606', 'Puraclenz', 'Puraclenz', 'Amal Abbasi', 'Christopher Dooley', 'Puraclenz, founded in 2020 and based in Old Greenwich, manufactures indoor air purifiers designed to clean air and surfaces at the source. The company has 8 employees and develops ozone-free ionization products effective against viruses, bacteria, allergens, and mold spores.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Amal Abbasi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-01 21:02:55', '2026-03-01 21:02:55', NULL),
