  ('zcrm_5797994000003772885', 'RxAll', 'RxAll', 'Amal Abbasi', 'Adebayo Alonge', 'Developer of a deep learning hyperspectral IoT platform designed for authenticating drugs in real-time. The company''s platform works through spectrometers and a cloud data set of spectral signatures of medicines to carry out non-destructive product authentication, enabling pharma manufacturers to get information in real-time about counterfeiting of their products and making high-quality medicines accessible to everyone at affordable prices.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Amal Abbasi', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 17:55:13', '2026-03-03 17:55:13', NULL),
