  ('zcrm_5797994000003773201', 'AscendArc', 'AscendArc', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Christopher McLain', 'Manufacturer of small geostationary satellites intended to revolutionize satellite communications. The company''s platform focuses on creating low-cost, rapidly deployable, high-bandwidth satellites with a scalable design and efficient manufacturing process, enabling the satellite industry to achieve cost-effective solutions for global communications with fast deployment, high performance, and lower operational costs compared to traditional fiber alternatives.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Riya Sabadra', '2026-03-01 18:34:38', '2026-03-11 08:24:20', '2026-03-11 08:24:20'),
