  ('zcrm_5797994000003773279', 'EnaChip', 'EnaChip', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Mark Allen Ph.D', 'Manufacturer of an integrated semiconductor microdevice intended to focus on the development of micro-magnetic components and devices. The company''s platform specializes in power management, inductors, signal isolation to sensors, actuators, and high-performance computing, among others, enabling companies with full-stack capable semiconductor technology with more efficient electronics at lower costs to meet the demanding requirements of current and future use cases.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Source', NULL, 'Founder Communication (no response etc.)', 'Riya Sabadra', '2026-03-01 18:46:43', '2026-03-11 08:26:56', '2026-03-11 08:26:56'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003773306', 'Firestorm', 'Firestorm', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Daniel Magy', 'Manufacturer of deployable micro-factories intended to modernize the way defense and industrial sectors build, deploy, and sustain systems. The company offers interconnected manufacturing platforms, embedded software, and microchips that support mission planning, autonomy, and coordination, enabling defense and industrial organizations to produce and maintain equipment on demand across distributed locations.', 'HV STEM', 'Manufacturing Technology', 'Spring 2026', 'Pitchbook', 'Reached Out', 'Riya Sabadra', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-01 18:50:36', '2026-03-01 18:50:36', NULL),
