  ('zcrm_5797994000003773493', 'GeneCapture', 'gene capture', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Peggy sammon', 'Developer of a medical diagnostic device designed to detect and identify pathogens and to bring infection detection to the point of care. The company''s device screens germs in blood, urine and wounds against a wide array of genetic signatures and reports the results within an hour, enabling medical professionals to detect bacterial and viral infections in a portable instrument for use in clinics, field applications, airports and at borders.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-04 07:49:33', '2026-03-04 07:49:33', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003773519', 'Kallisio', 'kallisio', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Rajan Patel', 'Developer of head and neck cancer solutions designed to safeguard your patients against radiation-induced harm. The company offers 3D printed patient-specific immobilization devices that provide unparalleled protection to organs at Risk (OARs) while allowing radoncs to deliver the effective dose of radiation treatment, enhancing treatment options and ultimately the quality of life for patients', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-04 07:59:36', '2026-03-04 07:59:36', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003773545', 'OncoPatch', 'OncoPatch', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Fredrick Sarazin', 'Developer of a single-use skin cancer treatment patch designed to provide a non-invasive local treatment option for non-melanoma skin cancer. The company develops a patch that delivers low-energy beta radiation directly to basal and squamous cell carcinoma lesions with shallow tissue penetration to limit exposure of surrounding healthy skin and is applied in an outpatient dermatology setting, enabling dermatologists and oncology clinics to treat eligible patients for localized non-melanoma skin cancers with reduced procedural complexity, pain, side effects, and cosmetic impact.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-04 08:09:54', '2026-03-04 08:09:54', NULL),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003773573', 'Hybernia Medical', 'Hybernia Medical', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Jai Choi', 'Developer of a cooling catheter system intended to help in the treatment of acute organ ischemia. The company''s system facilitates metabolic engineering of the ischemic tissue through controlled modulation of its thermal energy and delivers hypothermic protection to the organ in need, enabling medical service providers to apply it during endovascular stroke treatment.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Burhanudin Ayubali', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-04 08:32:58', '2026-03-04 08:32:58', NULL),
