  ('zcrm_5797994000003774255', 'Ambient Clinical Analytics', 'Ambient Clinical Analytics', 'Teja Lakamraju', 'Allen Berning', 'Developer of healthcare tools designed to reduce healthcare costs and improve patient outcomes. The company''s tools provide digital health and clinical decision support automation tools designed for bedside, nurse station, clinical command center, and remote monitoring, enabling physicians and medical personnel to spend more time with patients instead of reviewing information.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Teja Lakamraju', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 09:51:22', '2026-03-03 09:51:22', NULL),
