  ('zcrm_5797994000003774307', 'Hydrocision', 'Hydrocision', 'Teja Lakamraju', 'Thomas Aberg', 'Operator of a medical device company intended to focus on the commercialization of proprietary fluidjet technology. The company offers services to improve surgical outcomes by adapting water-jet technology to various medical applications, controlling a hair-thin, high-pressure stream of sterile saline to selectively resect and remove tissue of various densities from a surgical site in a minimally invasive manner, enabling clinical and economic outcomes in multiple fields of surgery.', 'HV STEM', 'Healthcare', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Teja Lakamraju', 'Source', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 09:54:17', '2026-03-03 09:54:17', NULL),
