  ('zcrm_5797994000003776724', 'SheMate', 'SheMate', 'Mia Dansby', 'Teresa Friesen', 'Operator of a virtual wellness and mentoring platform intended to navigate women''s future decisions intentionally and strategically. The company''s platform establishes a place for women to thrive and provides high school students with customized, empowering messages from positive female role models, enabling female athletes to share their stories in communities and students to benefit from their positivity and motivation.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Mia Dansby', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 11:21:12', '2026-03-03 11:21:12', '2026-03-03 11:21:12'),
