  ('zcrm_5797994000003776794', 'HUSO', 'HUSO', 'Mia Dansby', 'Larry Doochin', 'Developer of a sound frequency device designed for holistic health and wellness. The company''s device aids in providing sleeplessness, drowsiness, and focus issues by recalibrating the body and mind''s relaxation through the body''s electromagnetic field at the cellular level and generating oscillating waveforms to restore healthy resonant frequencies in the brain and body, enabling users to relax their minds as well as bodies and reduce sleep and stress-related disorders.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Mia Dansby', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 11:24:35', '2026-03-03 11:24:35', '2026-03-03 11:24:35'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003776829', 'SolitonReach', 'SolitonReach', 'Mia Dansby', 'Jessie Zhao', 'Developer of a wireless motion capture system designed to provide inertial measurement sensing of functional movement and range of motion analysis. The company provides a medical rehabilitation motion capture system with small, lightweight, wireless sensors, enabling medical practitioners to eliminate dependence on camera-based tracking systems for surgical robots.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Mia Dansby', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 11:26:41', '2026-03-03 11:26:41', '2026-03-03 11:26:41'),
  ('zcrm_5797994000003776864', 'Every Mother', 'Every Mother', 'Mia Dansby', 'Allison Rapaport', 'Developer of a fitness platform intended to offer evidence-based prenatal and postnatal care for mothers. The company''s platform offers progressive and efficient workouts and fitness programs at all stages of motherhood, training for faster and easier labor, enabling pregnant women to restore core strength and resolve diastasis recti in under twelve weeks.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Mia Dansby', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 11:29:27', '2026-03-03 11:29:27', '2026-03-03 11:29:27'),
