  ('zcrm_5797994000003776935', 'Ruffian Snowbikes', 'Ruffian Snowbikes', 'Mia Dansby', 'Derek Corey', 'Manufacturer of motorized snowbikes designed for deep snow travel and adventures across diverse terrains. The company integrates electric models with flotation systems, modular designs for easy maintenance, and rider-centric machines that excel in challenging conditions, enabling off-road riders to traverse snow with increased control, efficiency, and long-term durability.', 'HV Genesis', 'Sports and Wellness', 'Spring 2026', NULL, 'Reached Out', 'Mia Dansby', 'Source', 'Sports & Wellness', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-03 11:36:03', '2026-03-03 11:36:03', '2026-03-03 11:36:03'),
